{"id":"5113df68bb408cd8","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Radon Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure — ZFC Measure4 Radon Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure","58-df-zfc-measure8-radon-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure — ZFC Measure4 Radon Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-radon-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure — ZFC Measure4 Radon Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92553ae434bb637e\" href=\"?note=92553ae434bb637e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (Borel measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S\\)</span> (Borel-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92553ae434bb637e\" href=\"?note=92553ae434bb637e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compact-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RadonMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{RadonMeasure}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}radon\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{RadonMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\to\\mu(K)&lt;\\infty\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(A)=\\sup\\bigl\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\land\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}radon\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{RadonMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\to\\mu(K)&lt;\\infty\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(A)=\\sup\\bigl\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\land\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measure is required to be a Borel measure, finite on compact sets, inner regular by compact sets, and outer regular by open sets.</li>\n<li>Compactness is evaluated in the explicit subspace topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\">\\(\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\)</span>; a topology is a set of opens and cannot be passed through the function-restriction operator.</li>\n<li>The alias <code>58-df-zfc-measure8-radon-measure</code> denotes this same definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"92553ae434bb637e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"92553ae434bb637e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S$ (Borel-measure predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-measure3-borel-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Compact}_S$ (compact-space predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RadonMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}radon\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{RadonMeasure}(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3BorelMeasure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mu)\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\to\\mu(K)<\\infty\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl(\\mu(A)=\\sup\\bigl\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\bigl(K,\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\land\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1675,"backlinks":[{"id":"6f2943d50508785c","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{RadonMeasure}$ (Radon-measure predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2599","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-radon-measure]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["92553ae434bb637e","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}